<title>UK: Philip Morris sets 300 million mark six-year bond.</title>
<headline>Philip Morris sets 300 million mark six-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Bank-Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PHILIP MORRIS COS INC</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.625 PCT MATURITY    01.NOV.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.81    PAY DATE    01 NOV.96</p>
<p> REOFFER    99.51     SPREAD	+42 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A2	  LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.325 PCT SELL CONC   1.80 PCT</p>
<p> LIST FEE   0.50 PCT</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.25 PCT BUND DUE OCT 2002</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
